    <ol:summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Knowledge coverage is the accessible local repository, release notes and current checks. Prior chats/external issue backlog and external release receipts are unavailable in this session. Preserve the distinction between history claims and tested facts.</ol:summary>
