    <ol:summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">package.json includes app/**/* and an existing app/ontolink-skills copy is present. Inspect packaging and agree how to exclude/relocate the user copy before building a new release; preserve the active .agents package and canonical graph.</ol:summary>
