    <ol:status rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DONE</ol:status>
    <ol:summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Documented historical implementation: [1.3.1] - 2026-11-15; Fixed; CHANGELOG.md:9. DONE accepts retrospective import/provenance only; current behavior is covered only where a named test exists. Original execution receipts unavailable.</ol:summary>
    <ol:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Android's font policy now permits the embedded font data. Cairo, Almarai and Tajawal load offline, and the selected font applies to the editor as well as the preview.</ol:title>
    <ol:usesArtifact rdf:resource="urn:ontolink:project:mdx-reader-1ce34f1/changelog-source" />
    <ol:usesArtifact rdf:resource="urn:ontolink:project:mdx-reader-1ce34f1/source-manifest" />
